    "Requests are forwarded to your Poke agent once your API key is saved. The key stays in macOS Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anfragen gehen an deinen Poke-Agenten, sobald dein API-Schlüssel gespeichert ist. Der Schlüssel bleibt im macOS-Schlüsselbund."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requests go directly to built-in Home Assistant Assist. Test the connection before listening. Check results in Home Assistant if a request times out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anfragen gehen direkt an das integrierte Home Assistant Assist. Teste die Verbindung vor dem Zuhören. Prüfe das Ergebnis in Home Assistant, wenn eine Anfrage in ein Timeout läuft."
          }
        }
      }
    },
