    "Smart routing": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smart-Routing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smart routing sends device commands (lights, heating, covers, rooms and your imported names) to Home Assistant, and questions, reminders, timers, calendar and weather to Poke. Each request still goes to exactly one backend, with no fallback or retry on the other. The Activity list shows where each one went.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Smart-Routing schickt Gerätebefehle (Licht, Heizung, Rollläden, Räume und deine importierten Namen) an Home Assistant, Fragen, Erinnerungen, Timer, Kalender und Wetter an Poke. Jede Anfrage geht weiterhin an genau ein Backend, ohne Fallback oder Wiederholung beim anderen. Die Aktivitätsliste zeigt, wohin jede ging."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some targets failed; check Home Assistant": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
